              "value": {
                "html": "<ol data-layout=\"source-subparts\" type=\"a\"><li data-list-marker=\"а)\">Ре­ши­те урав­не­ние  <span data-inline-latex=\"\\sqrt{4\\cos 2x-2\\sin 2x}=2\\cos x\"></span>.</li><li data-list-marker=\"б)\">Ука­жи­те корни этого урав­не­ния, при­над­ле­жа­щие от­рез­ку  <span data-inline-latex=\"[-\\frac{5\\pi}{2};0]\"></span> . </li></ol>",
                "title": "Условие",
                "asset_keys": []
              },
              "operation": "rewrite",
              "transformation_target_id": "section:condition:1"
            },
            {
              "at": "2026-10-02T15:38:19.660842+00:00",
              "by": {
                "type": "pipeline",
                "stage": "deterministic_svg"
              },
              "value": {
                "html": "<p>а)  <span data-inline-latex=\"\\{2\\pi k;-\\frac{\\pi}{4}+2\\pi k\\mid k\\in\\mathbb{Z}\\}\"></span> ;  б)  <span data-inline-latex=\"-\\frac{9\\pi}{4}\"></span> ,   <span data-inline-latex=\"-2\\pi\"></span> ,  <span data-inline-latex=\"-\\frac{\\pi}{4}\"></span> ,  0.</p>",
                "title": "Ответ",
                "asset_keys": []
              },
              "operation": "rewrite",
              "transformation_target_id": "section:answer:1"
            },
            {
              "at": "2026-10-02T15:38:19.660842+00:00",
              "by": {
                "type": "pipeline",
                "stage": "deterministic_svg"
              },
              "value": {
                "html": "<p><img alt=\"\" data-asset-id=\"ec200df2-1211-47ef-8ae3-132cb386c319\" data-asset-key=\"image_1\" data-transformation-target-id=\"asset:image_1\"/></p><p>а)  Пре­об­ра­зу­ем урав­не­ние при усло­вии <nobr> <span data-inline-latex=\"\\cos x\\ge 0\"></span>:</nobr></p><center><p> <span data-inline-latex=\"\\sqrt{4\\cos 2x-2\\sin 2x}=2\\cos x\\iff 4\\cos 2x-2\\sin 2x=4\\cos^{2} x\\iff\"></span> <br/> <span data-inline-latex=\"\\iff 4\\cos 2x-2\\sin 2x=2\\cos 2x+2\\iff \\cos 2x-\\sin 2x=1\\iff\"></span> <br/> <span data-inline-latex=\"\\iff \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\cos 2x-\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\sin 2x=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\iff \\cos (2x+\\frac{\\pi}{4})=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\iff\"></span> <br/> <span data-inline-latex=\"\\iff 2x+\\frac{\\pi}{4}=\\pm \\frac{\\pi}{4}+2\\pi k\\iff \\left[\\begin{aligned}2x=2\\pi k\\\\2x=-\\frac{\\pi}{2}+2\\pi k\\end{aligned}\\right..\\quad \\iff \\left[\\begin{aligned}x=\\pi k\\\\x=-\\frac{\\pi}{4}+\\pi k\\end{aligned}\\right..k\\in\\mathbb{Z}\"></span> . </p><p></p><p></p><p></p></center><p> Усло­вию  <span data-inline-latex=\"\\cos x\\ge 0\"></span> удо­вле­тво­ря­ют толь­ко <span data-inline-latex=\"x=2\\pi k\"></span>, <span data-inline-latex=\"x=-\\frac{\\pi}{4}+2\\pi k\"></span>,  <span data-inline-latex=\"k\\in\\mathbb{Z}\"></span> .</p><p>б)  Отберём корни, при­над­ле­жа­щие от­рез­ку  <span data-inline-latex=\"[-\\frac{5\\pi}{2};0]\"></span> ,  при по­мо­щи еди­нич­ной окруж­но­сти. Под­хо­дят  <span data-inline-latex=\"-\\frac{9\\pi}{4}\"></span> ,   <span data-inline-latex=\"-2\\pi\"></span> ,  <span data-inline-latex=\"-\\frac{\\pi}{4}\"></span> ,  0.</p>",
                "title": "Решение",
                "asset_keys": [
                  "image_1"
                ]
              },
              "operation": "rewrite",
              "transformation_target_id": "section:solution:1"
            },
